  // ArtSource/Kit/Coins.json) at the rects its notes give: the coin, the two reward-block looks (gold
  // double keyline; crimson for the block the next ad pays), the light behind the coins, the three coin
  // piles with their contact shadows, the connector lines and the play triangle.
  // Every word is a label. The title, subtitle and heading are fixed copy (keys below); everything
  // else is written by EarnCoinsPresenter from IWallet and IAdRewards, with the ui.earn_coins.* format
  // strings: the balance, "Ad {0}", "{0} coins", the progress, the button's "Watch ad • +{0} coins",
  // and the reset line. EarnCoinsCustomizer adds the states the mockup doesn't draw: the crimson look
  // on every block (block 0 is drawn with it here only to say which sprite it is), the watched check.
